	(text "FMC adapter for the ADS7057 backplane"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 5 5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d2c3b1a3-c39b-40b4-8003-ac5ae5dd31e4")
	)
	(text "Plugs into the ZedBoard FMC LPC connector (J1 in the ZedBoard schematic). Eight SN74LVC8T245 level shifters: A side = VADJ (any of 1.8 / 2.5 / 3.3 V, so no J18 change is needed), B side = 3.3 V from the FMC 3P3V pins."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ed889dd4-ea53-428d-8872-cbd878666f98")
	)
	(text "58 lines: 18 outputs (16 chip selects, 2 SCLK) and 40 inputs (16 WAKE_N, 16 BIG_N, 8 SDO lanes). Outputs have 47 R series resistors for the ribbon. SDO lane inputs have 100 k pull-downs (SDO is Hi-Z while no card is selected)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "04c067f1-e537-4015-8294-4dee45d94a4d")
	)
	(text "PRSNT_M2C_L (H2) is grounded and TDI is tied to TDO (D30-D31), as the FMC standard asks a mezzanine without JTAG devices; the ZedBoard adds the FMC to the JTAG chain when it sees PRSNT."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "065ecab1-63f0-4ffb-9b57-de6499b72da8")
	)
